  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Notthe.jpg\" title=\"The Not The Rumored Refinery Forerat\"><img alt=\"The Not The Rumored Refinery Forerat\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"218\" src=\"/images/Notthe.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Notthe.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>The Not The Rumored Refinery Forerat</div></div></div>\n<p>The Not The Rumored Refinery Forerat is a huge Whisker <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Champions\" title=\"Category:Champions\">Champion</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Not The Rumored Refinery</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a> Level 4.  He is usually accompanied by <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker\" title=\"Whisker\">Whisker Prospectors</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Star Fizz-Soaked Blademasters</a>.  He is a Quest object.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
